{{Quote|Well, there's soil traces from the Tarabba sector.''"<br />"''Figured that much when the Toydarian mentioned a land of plains and gorges. Isn't Utapau in Tarabba?|[[Landonis Balthazar Calrissian|Lando Calrissian]] and [[Han Solo]]|<ref name="Last Shot">''[[Last Shot]]''</ref>}}
The '''Tarabba sector''' was a [[sector]] of the [[Outer Rim Territories]] region of [[the galaxy]]. It contained the [[Utapau system]],<ref name="USW" /> which included the [[planet]] [[Utapau]], [[homeworld]] of the [[Pau'an]] and [[Utai]] [[species]].<ref name="ROTS" /> During the [[Clone Wars]], Utapau was first the site of a [[Jedi]] [[Mission to Utapau|mission]],<ref name="ADOU" /> and then a major [[Battle of Utapau|battle]] between [[Galactic Republic]] and [[Confederacy of Independent Systems|Separatist]] forces.<ref name="ROTS" />

